% A value as Excel reads it in arithmetic: a number as itself, TRUE as 1, FALSE as 0, a text of digits as its number; any other text has no number (Excel shows #VALUE!).
a value counts in arithmetic as the value if
    prolog (number(the value)).

a value counts in arithmetic as a number if
    prolog (string(the value))
    and prolog (number_string(the number, the value)).

true counts in arithmetic as 1.

false counts in arithmetic as 0.

