% Pt 3 MLR and Rebate Calculation!F23: =IF(OR(F$19<1000,F$19>=75000),0,F$20*F$22)
the 5 credibility adjustment for 4 health insurance coverage individual is a rate R if
    the 1 life years for 4 health insurance coverage individual is a number N
    and the 1 life years for 4 health insurance coverage individual is a number M
    and R is equal to 0
        and it is not the case that
            it is not the case that N < 1000
            and it is not the case that M >= 75000
        otherwise the 2 base credibility factor is a rate K
        and the 4 deductible factor is a number P
        and R = K * P.

