% ASKING THE WORKBOOK ITSELF. Instead of this translation, a program can ask
% the workbook (sources/cms_mlr_2025.xlsm) for its answers: declare it as a service, give a
% template to each answer it needs, and say which cells answer the template
% (Logical English 2, docs/user/integrations/spreadsheets.md). A draft, to
% copy out of the comment, keeping the answers needed and rewording them:
%
%   the knowledge base cms_mlr service includes these services:
%       workbook at sheet:sources/cms_mlr_2025.xlsm as a calculator.
%
%   the cells of service workbook are:
